WEBVTT

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:29.000
Give it a try if you think you can do it, Hachi!

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:31.920
Nanael-san.

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:36.220
Let me show you how much power I have now! {TLC alt: Let me show you how much power I have now !}

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:37.970
Brace yourself!

00:00:38.990 --> 00:00:40.720
There!

00:00:57.060 --> 00:00:59.100
Heaven is so boring.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:04.930
All the top angels slip by me at the last moment. My dreams of a harem are never going to come true. {I mean, at the last moment, being a top angel slipped from me (no grasp.. but it is implied) My dreams of a harem are never going to come true.}

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:07.700
I'm so bored!{Fibi: I'm sure I could find something to excite you...}

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:14.400
Being on the ground world {lib: Earth}with Melpha, the big-breasted Mama, the rookie{lit: inept/unskilled} Reina and everyone else was a lot more exciting.

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:18.390
It was even worth it to mess around with the pink plasticinel{buyopin} and the infernal maid.

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:21.550
Why is this place so boring?

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:25.610
If this is how it has to be, then having peace at any price is too expensive! {lit: having peace any price is too much of a price/too much of one.}

00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:30.080
Honestly, could you please not complain in front of me?

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:35.090
Besides, I know you have free time and all, but could you please not summon me for no reason? {if you don't have business with me}{liberal alt: Besides, just because you have free time, it doesn't mean you should summon me for no reason!}

00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:39.120
Hey, today's your turn to keep watch on the holy grapes, right?

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:40.440
Correct!

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:41.620
Oh, right!

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:44.700
I just thought of a good idea!{Fibi: Me too! *fap fap fap*}

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:46.120
No.

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:48.120
I haven't said anything ye—

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:55.330
Nanael-san, when your eyes look like that, when you talk like that, and when your face lights up like that, you're definitely up to something bad!

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:58.070
How rude, Hachi!

00:01:58.070 --> 00:02:05.870
Well, I don't really want to say this, but I just happened to hear the top angels say that you give off a creepy vibe. {lit: creepy/digusting/lame}

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:07.840
You're kidding! {You are kidding !}

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:11.130
It's true. That's the rumor going around here.

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:13.480
I'll take this chance to make something clear to you.

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:16.970
Don't ever follow me around, okay?

00:02:18.830 --> 00:02:20.660
Well, that's how it is.

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:25.330
She left.

00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:31.230
You're naked, Nanael-san. {Fibi: That's how I like her...}

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:39.360
This is the part where I get Hachi's holy grapes! {can't get the adj between Hachi no and seinaru} {TLC's take This is the one time to get Haichi's holy grapes while she is away.}

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:41.680
I'm so smart!

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:46.840
The rumor says that if you eat a holy grape, any of your desires will be granted!

00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:49.950
This means that I have to go eat it!

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:02.730
What is all this?

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:07.670
I'll make a harem in this boring Heaven!

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:27.080
That's the holy grape tree, isn't it? I did it! {lit: }

00:03:29.190 --> 00:03:31.500
It's pretty big. {Fibi: You should've seen it while you were bathing.}

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:33.940
Let's see.

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:38.990
I found the holy grapes!

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:44.890
Harem, harem. {Fibi: Nanael should join mine.... time to update the sig!}

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:49.740
What is this!?

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:53.450
Nanael-san, what are you doing?

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:55.830
It's exactly what it looks like! Don't get in my way!

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:59.830
You can't steal these grapes and eat them!

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:02.950
Shut up! I can have just one, can't I? {Fibi: 58:83 actual start, "U" from Urusai overlapped with previous line. Haven't overlapped the timings though, your call}

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:06.630
No, not even one!

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:10.120
You're so stingy! No one's going to find out if you don't tell!

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:12.300
How could you say that? No means no!

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:17.480
No, my harem!

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:29.520
Good grief, people like you are so...

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:33.530
The holy grapes are something for God to eat.

00:04:33.530 --> 00:04:36.450
No one is to lay a hand on them.

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:41.350
And to think you're stealing them for your own greed... {TLC Alt: And to thnk you are stealing them for your own greed...}

00:04:41.350 --> 00:04:46.380
That's because it was a coincidence. Just a coincidence!

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:52.560
I just happened to be passing by, and a mischievous wind made a single grape drop.

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:55.330
I was quite surprised at the time.

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:58.450
It seems you want to create a harem.

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:02.400
I-I wonder about that.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:05.760
I am doubtful of the character that you show as an angel.

00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:10.830
No matter when, I'm ever and always putting forth my best efforts as an angel!

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:11.490
Listen!

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:15.680
I gave you an order to investigate the swamp the other day.

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:18.740
You pushed the task onto the nun Melpha from the imperial capital, didn't you? {TLC Alt:You push the task to Saint Melpha from the imperial captial, didn't you ?}

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:20.110
Eek.

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:21.300
She's found you out.

00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:25.790
I believed in you and gave you orders.

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:27.950
To think you let her handle it herself...

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:30.280
There are limits to how ignorant you can be.

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:32.900
But—

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:34.360
No excuses!

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:38.350
Even God would find it difficult to reform that remorseless attitude of yours.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:42.660
This time, you shall fall down to the realm of the dead! {lib: Hell}

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:51.630
Chief Angel{Tenshi-jousama}, I will reform my ways and become diligent from now on! {Fibi: I want to get behind that....}

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:54.670
I beg of you. Please spare from me that!

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:57.460
I'm tired of hearing those words.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:04.930
Please forgive me! {TLC} {Please show mercy !}

00:06:05.570 --> 00:06:09.540
Hachi, you ask her too! I've done so much for yo— {hachi ! Plead for me as well ! I've done so much for yo-}

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:15.160
Nanael-san, take care!

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:21.100
Ouch.

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:28.150
The Swamp Witch's punishment is always so intense.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:32.680
It was bound to happen.{There was nothing we could do about it.} After all, we didn't come back with Menace.

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:38.460
If we don't do something big, {lit: accomplishment/feat}things are going to turn out bad.

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:41.880
Indeed.

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:46.000
Is that...

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:47.120
What?

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:48.900
...an angel?

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:51.040
It seems so.

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:59.440
Airi, this might be the chance of a lifetime! {Airi, this might be our once in a lifetime chance.}

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:00.740
Chance?

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:03.390
Leave it to me.

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:04.810
Okay.

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:16.880
Hey... what is this?

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:19.780
Finally awake now, stupid angel?

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:21.220
What!?

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:25.670
Pink plasticine and the Infernal Maid?

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.720
Wait, where is this?

00:07:28.370 --> 00:07:32.870
Why are you playing dumb? We're obviously in the swamp.

00:07:32.870 --> 00:07:36.000
You were heading to the realm of the dead when you fell, right?

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:38.810
We captured you because it seemed interesting.

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:42.170
You probably did something and became a fallen angel, didn't you?

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:43.020
Eek.

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:47.310
We don't know that. She might have fallen on purpose.

00:07:47.310 --> 00:07:49.010
What do you mean on purpose?

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:52.520
There's a possibility she's here to launch a surprise attack from somewhere we'd never expect. {Fibi: I normally try to avoid extending over other sounds, so haven't here, but it's a long line so you may feel it should extend to the next line.}

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:54.700
No, no, no way!

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:56.150
You sound like an idiot.

00:07:56.150 --> 00:07:57.650
Idiot?

00:07:57.650 --> 00:08:01.290
It really makes me mad when you call me an idiot, Melona.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:02.700
Such idiots.

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:05.420
I'll take this chance to escape.

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:09.910
I don't feel any power.

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:13.790
Why? Why!? My angel powers are gone?

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:17.210
Could I really be in a seriously bad situation?

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:22.200
What's wrong with calling you an idiot if you're an idiot?

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:24.640
Hey there!

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:28.160
I'll tell you.

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:32.870
I came down on purpose to tell you guys something.

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:38.310
And that's how it is! Got it?

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:44.340
Heaven's troops are getting close to this place, so you went through the trouble of coming to tell us.

00:08:44.340 --> 00:08:44.910
That's right!

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:47.990
Nanael-san is offering her kindness to us.

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:54.450
Right! I don't care either way, but it's not like you guys didn't know anyway.

00:08:55.350 --> 00:08:57.420
How very suspicious.

00:08:57.420 --> 00:08:59.680
There's a limit to how fishy something can sound.

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:04.100
She needs some punishment.

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:05.890
Punishment?

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:15.480
What, what, what the!?

00:09:16.090 --> 00:09:18.610
No, s-stay away!

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:24.230
It's just some relaxing torture. It'll make you want to talk your heart out. {first phrase unsure}{Its an intensive torture}

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:27.990
The sooner you confess, the better it'll be for your body.

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:33.230
Don't take anymore off!{Fibi: OH FUCK... panties... so close... damn}

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:35.180
S-Stop!

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:37.010
I can't breathe!

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:38.420
No more!

00:09:43.740 --> 00:09:47.050
This is... a holy grape. It was stuck!

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:50.160
I still have some luck on my side!

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:59.200
I've finally done it.

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:02.120
Now any of my desires will come true!

00:10:03.980 --> 00:10:09.190
But the reason this happened to me in the first place was because of Hachi telling the Chief Angel.

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:14.480
The Chief Angel even dropped me down to the realm of dead over a simple holy grape.

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:15.700
How unbelievable!

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:19.580
If I had known, I would have just rampaged around in Heaven.

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:24.000
Right. I can just do it right now. {I can just do it right now}

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:28.440
With the power of the holy grape, I can just get another chance.

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:33.260
If I do that, I can get my harem or do anything I want!

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:42.470
Airi, the Swamp Witch hasn't completely revived, and yet we're leaving the swamp.

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:45.530
She really trusts us, doesn't she?

00:10:45.530 --> 00:10:47.380
I suppose so.

00:10:48.570 --> 00:10:51.100
I hope so.

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:56.430
But you know, bad things happen at times like this.

00:10:56.430 --> 00:10:57.700
Wait, what?

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:04.330
It looks creepy up close.

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.390
What's going to happen from now on?

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:08.050
I don't know!

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:16.850
Well, in her case, Nanael-san got what she deserved.

00:11:16.850 --> 00:11:21.400
This was late considering how much she's done up until now.

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:28.160
I say that, but it breaks my heart to think about whether or not we should've cornered her this much.

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:30.400
It was bound to happen.

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:31.360
Besides...

00:11:31.810 --> 00:11:32.650
Besides?

00:11:41.580 --> 00:11:46.040
The hot springs here are so fabulously stimulating. They really are the best! {Fibi: HNNNNNNNGGG}

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:50.460
What are you planning? You want to make the fallen angel our ally?

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:53.470
It's better to have more allies right?

00:11:53.470 --> 00:11:57.850
The stupid angel is simple-minded, so all we have to do is lay on the flattery.

00:11:58.530 --> 00:11:59.550
Don't you think so?

00:12:00.590 --> 00:12:04.450
True. Menace isn't coming back either.

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:06.350
Her power is somewhat enticing.

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:11.080
Right! Besides, doesn't it just seem kind of fun?

00:12:14.530 --> 00:12:16.350
What is it? {What is it ?}

00:12:16.350 --> 00:12:18.890
It's a rare occasion, so let's talk.

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:22.920
Allies have to tell each other things.

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:27.790
We're talking our master, the Swamp Witch{-sama}.

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:31.930
The Swamp Witch hasn't had a physical form up until now,

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:37.310
so in her place, we eliminated any calamities directed at the Swamp Witch.

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:39.420
but we don't need to do that anymore.

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:42.210
In short, she has been revived.

00:12:42.210 --> 00:12:48.370
Well, you guys are certainly super weak, so even the Swamp Witch would be in a rush.

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:50.000
W-What did you say?

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:54.170
In any case, the balance of power is going to change after this.

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:57.320
You'd be better off being on our side.

00:12:59.850 --> 00:13:03.990
Do your best to serve Master.

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:10.090
Like I said, as long as you do as we promised, I'll help you out. {Fib: *fap fap fap*}

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:12.350
As we promised, huh?

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:14.030
We know.

00:13:14.030 --> 00:13:16.000
Harem, a harem!

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:20.850
She's just made out of greed, isn't she? {lib alt: She's just made out of greed, isn't she?} {She is a mass of desire, isn't she}

00:13:20.850 --> 00:13:23.230
Are you sure we should let her be?

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:26.220
Well, we did promise.

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:29.010
Melona, you're being unusually honest.

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:33.650
That's not it. You saw him before, didn't you Airi? The fallen angel, Delmora.

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:38.660
That power really brings my hopes up.

00:13:38.660 --> 00:13:41.840
Hey, Infernal Maid!

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:44.540
Come over here and pour me some alcohol!

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:46.780
Pink Plasticine, massage my feet!

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:48.960
Okay, I'm on my way.

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:53.170
Oh, you're being awfully obedient.

00:13:53.170 --> 00:13:54.920
It's my nature as a maid.

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:29.280
How about you get to working for Master already?

00:14:29.280 --> 00:14:32.790
Go do something like wither a forest or attack a human city!

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:37.950
Nope, no. I'm not interested in doing such trivial things.

00:14:37.950 --> 00:14:39.470
I'll let you guys handle it.

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:41.270
What did you say?

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:43.580
And up I go.

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:45.870
I'm heading out.

00:14:46.730 --> 00:14:52.120
Hey! I'm not finished talking to you. Wait!

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:54.070
Jeez. {Geez}

00:14:57.150 --> 00:15:01.050
The stupid angel really is just a stupid angel.

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:09.280
Nanael-sama, I am happy that I am able to see you again.

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:11.480
I know, right?{Fibi: Melpha GTFO}

00:15:11.480 --> 00:15:15.670
Worship me! Respect me! Revere me!

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:17.960
Yes!

00:15:18.340 --> 00:15:21.700
I came here today to pick you up like I promised.

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:23.880
When you say that,

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:25.930
are you, perhaps, talking about the harem?

00:15:25.930 --> 00:15:27.710
That's right. The harem!

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:31.240
Well, it's still small, but we're starting now.

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:35.250
We'll expand operations, and someday I plan for it to be continental-wide.

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:39.220
Well, there would be risks with going Heaven-wide,

00:15:39.220 --> 00:15:41.350
but there's nothing I can do about that.

00:15:41.350 --> 00:15:42.020
And so—

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:43.140
Nanael-sama.

00:15:47.270 --> 00:15:49.220
What has happened? {Fibi: Actually Melpha doesn't look bad here, I guess it's just a poor choice of clothes normally.}

00:15:49.220 --> 00:15:51.180
Those black wings...

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:54.740
A bunch of stuff happened in Heaven.

00:15:54.740 --> 00:16:01.750
Well, to sum up it, I'm giving up being an archangel, and I think I'm going to try being a fallen archangel from now on.

00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:04.260
Fallen archangel?

00:16:05.010 --> 00:16:06.530
That's right.

00:16:06.530 --> 00:16:09.380
What? You have a problem with that? {}

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:13.310
Oh, come on! Melpha too? {What the.... Melpha as well ?}

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:16.690
The archangel became a fallen archangel. That's all.

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:19.670
Honestly, it just worries me.

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:26.290
Hey, why are you looking at me like that? Does this mean you won't accept me if I'm not an archangel?

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:29.710
I'm done with this! Bye!

00:16:31.210 --> 00:16:35.220
I finally even taught her the joy of a harem too.

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:38.940
In the end, Melpha only looks at appearance and titles. {Fibi: I may have read this as titties the first time.}

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:41.530
That's how it's always been.

00:16:44.760 --> 00:16:49.910
What holds true is that I'm not an angel anymore. That's all.

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:55.920
Geez! Everything is just pissing me off! {making me mad/upset/angry}

00:16:57.280 --> 00:17:00.150
Isn't that Nanael?

00:17:00.150 --> 00:17:05.800
It really is. I heard she dropped down to the realm of the dead, but why is she out here?

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:06.870
I'm not sure.

00:17:07.640 --> 00:17:10.740
I should probably report this to the Chief Angel. {Fibi: Audio only bleeds slightly, so might not be worth extending past scene change. Your call.}

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:11.470
Yes.

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:19.290
I've waited long enough. I'm extremely mad now. {TLC Alt: My patience is already at its limits. I'm extremely mad now}

00:17:19.290 --> 00:17:23.970
That fallen angel... We will only keep the Master waiting at this rate. {TLC at the verb} {That fallen angel... We will only keep the Master waiting at this rate.}

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:25.360
Yeah.

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:26.850
What?

00:17:31.890 --> 00:17:33.430
What in the world is happening?

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:36.640
She... she's gone out of control!

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.600
The fallen angel Nanael.

00:17:45.010 --> 00:17:48.950
If she lets loose here, something terrible will happen to the swamp!

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:54.080
Go, my lowly spirits! {teikyuureitachi}

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:04.370
My lowly spirits have...

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:06.410
Airi, look out!

00:18:16.380 --> 00:18:17.780
How dare you do that to Airi!

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:24.010
I'm not done yet!

